Dixie Leonard, played by Bette Midler.

5
00:46:00,000 --> 00:46:06,000
Eddie Sparks, played by James Caan.

6
00:55:12,000 --> 00:55:18,000
Art Silver, played by George Segal.

7
01:04:24,000 --> 01:04:30,000
Shephard, played by Patrick O'Neal.

8
01:13:36,000 --> 01:13:42,000
Danny Leonard, played by Christopher Rydell.

9
01:22:48,000 --> 01:22:54,000
Jeff Brooks, played by Arye Gross.

10
01:32:00,000 --> 01:32:06,000
The Boys (aka The Guys) is a drama/black comedy television
film starring James Woods and John Lithgow.

11
01:41:12,000 --> 01:41:18,000
It was directed by Glenn Jordan, who had previously worked with Woods on the 1986 TV movie
Promise and later worked with Woods again in 1994 for the TV drama film Jane's House.

12
01:50:24,000 --> 01:50:30,000
The film first aired on September 15, 1991 on the ABC Network.

13
01:59:36,000 --> 01:59:42,000
The film explores themes of concert, dancer, entertainer.

14
02:08:48,000 --> 02:08:54,000
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
